OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal to woman after
OL,4,AReform UK audience row
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have asked a woman who had her
OL,7,Fhair and head grabbed at the Reform UK
OL,8,Fconference to come forward as they
OL,9,Fcarry out an investigation.
OL,11,FFootage circulating on social media has
OL,12,Fshown audience members pulling the
OL,13,Fprotester back as disorder broke out
OL,14,Fduring the event at Birmingham's NEC.
OL,16,FDemonstrators were thrown out of the
OL,17,Fparty's annual conference after
OL,18,Finterrupting Nigel Farage's keynote
OL,19,Fspeech.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
